     "body": "<p>I think \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2920\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2920\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Remove DELETE Option on LDPCv\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2920\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (OPTION removal from LDPCv) seems to have fixed this, my test suite report says it passed.</p>",
